{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54977","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 一 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戈矛上，忽有火光明。\n兆主三军轻命战，管须（京本作「取」）交战我军赢，青焰不宜兵。\n（火青焰小如鬼火者主兵忧。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}